Gershwin System Preferences
===========================

url    = https://github.com/gershwin-desktop/gershwin-systempreferences.git
tag    = 26.09
commit = d5809a837f2f094ab22624ca5c0b1f010b7348e9
date   = 2026-09-17

Built by tools/desktop/build-systempreferences.sh, which foxyn-desktop(8)
runs on the desktop image (tools/linux/build.sh desktop): it downloads
this revision's archive, checks its SHA-256 and installs System
Preferences and the PreferencePanes framework in /System
(docs/desktop-workspace.md). It is not part of buildworld. Keep build
output outside the submodule. When upgrading, update the revision and
checksum in build-systempreferences.sh too.
License: GPL text in COPYING and LGPL text in PreferencePanes/COPYING.LIB; file-level review required. Complete provenance review and preserve applicable notices
and source obligations before distributing selected components.
On upgrade, review dependencies, ABI, installation paths and desktop tests.
